  "title": "Cuban Banana Casserole",
  "description": "Add a taste of Cuba to your dessert repertoire with this delightfully simple but unique dish. All you need are some bananas, brown sugar, butter, raisins, and pecans and you&#39;ll be on your way to a wonderful &#39;postre Cubano!&#39;",
